{
 "slug": "marke",
 "lines": [
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Stand on this rock, and you're in two countries and two time zones at once.",
   "chunks": [
    "STAND ON|THIS *ROCK,*",
    "AND YOU'RE IN|*TWO COUNTRIES*",
    "AND *TWO TIME ZONES*|AT ONCE."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "One step, and your clock jumps an hour.",
   "chunks": [
    "*ONE STEP,*",
    "AND YOUR CLOCK|JUMPS AN *HOUR.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Half is Sweden, half is Finland. And the border? It zigzags like it had way too much coffee.",
   "chunks": [
    "HALF IS *SWEDEN,*",
    "HALF IS *FINLAND.*",
    "AND THE *BORDER?*",
    "IT *ZIGZAGS* LIKE IT HAD",
    "WAY TOO MUCH *COFFEE.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "This is Märket: 350 metres of bare rock. No trees, no people. Just seals.",
   "chunks": [
    "THIS IS *MÄRKET:*",
    "*350 METRES*|OF BARE ROCK.",
    "NO TREES, NO PEOPLE.",
    "JUST *SEALS.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So who drew this mess?",
   "chunks": [
    "SO WHO DREW|THIS *MESS?*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Rewind to 1809. Sweden loses Finland to the Russian Empire.",
   "chunks": [
    "REWIND TO *1809.*",
    "SWEDEN *LOSES* FINLAND",
    "TO THE *RUSSIAN EMPIRE.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "The new border? A straight line, right through this rock.",
   "chunks": [
    "THE NEW *BORDER?*",
    "A *STRAIGHT LINE,*",
    "RIGHT THROUGH|THIS *ROCK.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Then, in 1885, Finland builds a lighthouse on the highest point. All two metres of it.",
   "chunks": [
    "THEN, IN *1885,*",
    "FINLAND BUILDS|A *LIGHTHOUSE*",
    "ON THE *HIGHEST POINT.*",
    "ALL *TWO METRES* OF IT."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Small problem. That point was in Sweden.",
   "chunks": [
    "SMALL *PROBLEM.*",
    "THAT POINT WAS|IN *SWEDEN.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Sweden was not thrilled.",
   "chunks": [
    "SWEDEN WAS|*NOT THRILLED.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "The lighthouse? It just liked the view.",
   "chunks": [
    "THE *LIGHTHOUSE?*",
    "IT JUST LIKED|THE *VIEW.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "And there it stood, in the wrong country, for 100 years.",
   "chunks": [
    "AND THERE IT STOOD,",
    "IN THE *WRONG COUNTRY,*",
    "FOR *100 YEARS.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "And the fix is even weirder.",
   "chunks": [
    "AND THE FIX IS|EVEN *WEIRDER.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "In 1985, instead of moving the lighthouse... they moved the border.",
   "chunks": [
    "IN *1985,*",
    "INSTEAD OF MOVING|THE LIGHTHOUSE...",
    "THEY MOVED|THE *BORDER.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Now the border bends around the tower in a 480 metre S.",
   "chunks": [
    "NOW THE BORDER *BENDS*",
    "AROUND THE TOWER",
    "IN A *480 METRE S.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Finland keeps the lighthouse, and Sweden gets the same area back.",
   "chunks": [
    "FINLAND KEEPS|THE *LIGHTHOUSE,*",
    "AND SWEDEN GETS|THE *SAME AREA* BACK."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "But remember, Sweden runs one hour behind Finland.",
   "chunks": [
    "BUT REMEMBER,",
    "SWEDEN RUNS|*ONE HOUR BEHIND*",
    "FINLAND."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So zigzag across that line, and you hop back and forth in time.",
   "chunks": [
    "SO *ZIGZAG*|ACROSS THAT LINE,",
    "AND YOU HOP|BACK AND FORTH",
    "IN *TIME.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Sweden's reward? An extra hour of sleep.",
   "chunks": [
    "SWEDEN'S *REWARD?*",
    "AN *EXTRA HOUR*|OF SLEEP."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So next time someone says you can't be in two places at once...",
   "chunks": [
    "SO NEXT TIME|SOMEONE SAYS",
    "YOU CAN'T BE|IN *TWO PLACES*",
    "AT ONCE..."
   ]
  }
 ],
